 family-friendly community, this well-maintained suite offers convenient access to parks, schools, shopping, dining, transit & major commuter routes. Bright, functional layout features a spacious living area, full kitchen w/fridge & stove, in suite laundry included, 2 well-sized bedrooms & private entrance. Utilities included in rent for added value & convenience. Ideal for professionals, couples or a small family seeking affordable living in a sought-after Surrey location. Street parking available. Close to all amenities while enjoying the comfort of an established neighbourhood. (id:67604)"},"30425345":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639281164968230000/reb6/highres/6/R3177176_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639281164968230000/reb6/highres/6/R3177176_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639281164968230000/reb6/highres/6/R3177176_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639281164968230000/reb6/highres/6/R3177176_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639281164968230000/reb6/highres/6/R3177176_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639281164968230000/reb6/highres/6/R3177176_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639281164968230000/reb6/highres/6/R3177176_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639281164968230000/reb6/highres/6/R3177176_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639281164968230000/reb6/highres/6/R3177176_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639281164968230000/reb6/highres/6/R3177176_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639281164968230000/reb6/highres/6/R3177176_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639281164968230000/reb6/highres/6/R3177176_12.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639281164968230000/reb6/highres/6/R3177176_13.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639281164968230000/reb6/highres/6/R3177176_14.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639281164968230000/reb6/highres/6/R3177176_15.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639281164968230000/reb6/highr